조; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">이메일</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">(minah@kumoh.ac.kr)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">제출 또는 직접 제출</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">(T458,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">국제교류교육원</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></p><table style=\"width: 21%; margin-right: calc(100% - 21.0000% - 0.0000%);\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background: rgb(210, 165, 231); padding: 1.41pt; width: 19.74%; height: 22.22pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><br></td><td style=\"padding: 1.41pt; width: 79.83%; height: 22.22pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><p><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 20px;\">참가 방식</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">외국인&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">명</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">한국인&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">명 자원 활동가로 팀 구성</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">팀별로 학기당&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">회&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">~ 3</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">회 담당 학교를 방문하여 문화 수업 실시</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">수업&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">회 참여 후 보고서 작성 제출</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 16px;\">프로그램 종료 후 경상북도교육청 수료증 발급</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></p><table style=\"width: 26%; margin-right: calc(100% - 26.0000% - 0.0000%);\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background: rgb(210, 165, 231); padding: 1.41pt; width: 18.08%; height: 22.22pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><br></td><td style=\"padding: 1.41pt; width: 81.57%; height: 22.22pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><p><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 20px;\">추진 일정</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><br></p><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"background: rgb(249, 237, 245); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 42.64pt; height: 29.97pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">번호</span></p></td><td style=\"background: rgb(249, 237, 245); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 195.46pt; height: 29.97pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">내용</span></p></td><td style=\"background: rgb(249, 237, 245); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 133.2pt; height: 29.97pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">추진 시기</span></p></td><td style=\"background: rgb(249, 237, 245); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 119.05pt; height: 29.97pt; vertical-align: middle;\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"text-align: cente